{{Effect at cast time end}}
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Smoke Screen|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Graves
|skill        = W
|icon         = Smoke Screen.png
|icon2        = Smoke Screen 2.png
|blurbicon         = Smoke Screen.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Graves}} fires a smoke canister at the target location that creates a cloud of smoke upon impact, dealing {{as|magic damage}} and {{tip|slow|slowing}} nearby enemies.
|blurb2       = Enemies within the lingering cloud are {{tip|nearsight|nearsighted}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Graves''' fires a smoke canister at the target location that upon impact deals {{as|magic damage}} to enemies within the area and {{tip|slow|slows}} them by 50% for {{fd|0.5}} seconds.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|60 to 260}} {{as|(+ 60% AP)}}}}
|description2 = The canister creates a cloud of smoke for 4 seconds that applies {{tip|nearsight}} of outside the area to all enemies within every {{fd|0.25}} seconds, reducing their {{tip|sight}} radius to {{tt|250 units|Estimated}} relative to the center.
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|26 to 18}}
|cost         = {{ap|70 to 90}}}
|costtype     = Mana
|target range = 950
|effect radius= {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|200|Canister landing damage radius}}
|speed        = {{tt|1500|Starts traveling at the start of the cast time}}
|projectile   = true
|targeting    = Location
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spelleffects = spellaoe
|spellshield  = Special
|outofrange   = walk to location
|notes        = 
* ''Smoke Screen'' will {{tip|nearsight}} {{tip|untargetable}} units.
* {{tip|Spell shield|Spell shields}} will block the instance of damage and {{tip|slow}}, but will not mitigate the persistent area of effect.
* {{tip|cc-immune|Crowd control immunity}} and {{tip|cleanse|cleanses}} have no effect on the user's {{tip|sight}} radius reduction despite the {{tip|nearsight}} being resisted / removed. Loss of allied vision will still be affected.{{bug|2}}
** Removing or resisting the nearsight will prevent it from being reapplied while staying inside the area (leaving and coming back inside will not).
* The nearsight debuff applies to non-champions but it does not inherently stop them from performing actions that require {{tip|sight}}, such as [[basic attack]]ing.
{{Effect at cast time end}}
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Collateral Damage|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Graves
|skill        = R
|icon         = Collateral Damage.png
|blurbicon    = Collateral Damage.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Graves}} {{tip|dash|recoils}} backward and fires an explosive shell in the target direction that deals {{as|physical damage}} to enemies it passes through.
|blurb2       = Upon hitting an enemy champion or max range, the shell explodes to deal {{as|physical damage}} in a cone.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Graves''' fires an explosive shell in the target direction that deals {{as|physical damage}} to enemies hit and causes him to {{tip|dash|recoil}} 400 units in the opposite direction.
|leveling     = {{st|Physical Damage|{{ap|275 to 575}} {{as|(+ 150% '''bonus''' AD)}}}}
|description2 = Upon hitting an enemy {{tip|champion}} or reaching the end of its range, the shell explodes in a cone to deal reduced damage to additional enemies.
|leveling2    = {{st|Reduced Damage|{{ap|200 to 440}} {{as|(+ 120% '''bonus''' AD)}}}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|100 to 60}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|cost         = 100
|costtype     = Mana
|range        = {{dv|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|1100|Shell missile range}}|{{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|1690|Maximum range including collateral cone, estimated}}}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|200|Shell missile width}}
|speed        = {{tt|2100|Shell missile speed. The explosion is instantaneous}}
|effect radius= {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|740|Collateral end cone width, estimated}}
|angle        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|60{{degree}}|Collateral cone angle, estimated}}
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = {{dv|Enemies|Self}}
|damagetype   = Physical
|spelleffects = Special
|spellshield  = special
|projectile   = True
|knockdown    = True
|grounded     = special
|notes        =
* Applies {{tip|spell damage}} to the target hit by the shell (including to non-champions struck before exploding{{bug}}) and {{tip|area damage}} to targets within the explosion cone.
* The projectile will still explode early if the champion hit by the shell is protected by a {{tip|spell shield}}.
* The explosion cone is anchored on the location of the shell missile when it collided with a champion, or otherwise its maximum cast range.
* The cone damage is always located 150 units behind, based off its direction
* ''Collateral Damage'' is not disabled while {{tip|ground|grounded}} or {{tip|root|rooted}}, but '''Graves''' will not dash after the cast time while affected by them.
* '''Graves''' will not {{tip|dash}} after the cast time if he is {{tip|airborne}}.
{{Effect at cast time end}}
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Onslaught of Shadows|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Hecarim
|skill        = R
|icon         = Onslaught of Shadows.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Hecarim}} summons spectral riders and {{tip|dash|charges}} in the target direction, dealing {{as|magic damage}} to enemies they pass through.
|blurb2       = Upon arrival, he {{tip|fear|fears}} and gradually {{tip|slow|slows}} enemies for a duration based on the distance traveled.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Hecarim''' {{tip|dash|dashes}} with {{tip|displacement immunity}} to the target location and summons 5 spectral riders {{tt|in an arrow formation|see notes}} that charge alongside him in the target direction, dealing {{as|magic damage}} to all enemies in their path and {{tip|standard sight|revealing}} them for {{fd|2.5}} seconds.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic damage|{{ap|150 to 350}} {{as|(+ 100% AP)}}}}
|description2 = Upon arrival, he {{tip|fear|fears}} nearby enemies for {{pp|type=distance traveled|0.75 to 1.5 for 11|0 to 1000}} seconds and {{tip|slow|slows}} them by {{pp|type=distance from '''Hecarim'''|0;0 to 99|0;150 to 300 by 25|formula=Minimum of 0% slow at &le;150 centered range from '''Hecarim''', maximum of 99% at 300 centered range from '''Hecarim''' (linearly interpolated).|key=%}}.
|description3 = ''The wave of spectral riders travels independently of '''Hecarim''' and will always charge at the same distance.''
|target range = {{tt|300 - 1000|Minimum and maximum dash distance}}
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|315|Fear radius around dash end}}
|range        = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|1510|Spectral riders missile range, estimated}}
|speed        = {{tt|1100|Both dash and spectral riders missile speed}}
|width        = {{dv|{{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|80|Individual spectral riders missile width}}|{{tt|480|Width of full effect given by outermost riders}}}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|140|120|100}}
|cost         = 100
|costtype     = Mana
|targeting    = Location
|cast time    = none
|damagetype   = Magic
|projectile   = True
|grounded     = True
|knockdown    = False
|spelleffects = spellaoe
|spellshield  = True
|outofrange   = cast at max
|notes   = 
* The spectral rider missiles originate at '''Hecarim's''' location, 145 units behind and 100 units to either side of him, and 290 units behind and 200 units to either side. They travel 1510 units forward parallel to Hecarim from their origin each.
* Only the spectral riders deal damage to enemies they pierce, '''Hecarim''' only dashes and fears enemies at the end of it.
* The slow improperly counts as an additive percent movement speed modifier rather than a multiplicative one.{{bug}}
** The strength is unaffected by {{tip|slow resist}} as a result of this behavior.
** This means it can unintentionally stack with the effects of other slows.
}}

