{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Harsh Lesson|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Illaoi
|skill        = W
|icon         = Harsh Lesson.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{cis|Illaoi}} next basic attack gains {{sti|'''bonus''' attack range}} and causes her to {{tip|dash|leap}} to her target, dealing {{as|'''additional''' physical damage|physical damage}} and commanding nearby {{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}} to attack the target.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Illaoi''' empowers her next {{tip|basic attack}} within 6 seconds to gain {{sti|range|225 '''bonus''' range}} and cause her to {{tip|dash|leap}} to the target's location if they are beyond her normal basic attack range.
|description2 = The attack deals {{as|'''additional''' physical damage|physical damage}}, with a minimum threshold, and capped at 300 against non-champions, and commands all {{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}} in range to attack the target. The minimum '''additional''' damage can also be applied against {{tip|turrets}}.
|leveling2     = {{st|Additional Physical Damage|{{as|{{ap|3 to 5}}% {{as|(+ {{fd|3.5}}% per 100 AD)}} of target's '''maximum''' health|health}}}}
{{st|Minimum Physical Damage|{{ap|20 to 60}}}}
|description3 = ''Harsh Lesson {{tip|basic attack reset|resets}} '''Illaoi's''' basic attack timer.''
|description4 = ''Harsh Lesson can be activated during '''Illaoi's''' other abilities.''
|cooldown     = 4
|cdstart      = post-effect
|cost         = 30
|costtype     = Mana
|queue time   = {{fd|0.5}}
|targeting    = Auto
|cast time    = none
|affects      = Self
|spelleffects = Special
|damagetype   = Physical
|spellshield  = Special
|grounded     = Special
|knockdown    = Special
|parry        = Special
|notes        = 
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* The damage of ''Harsh Lesson's'' attack portion is tagged as {{tip|basic damage}} and {{tip|spell damage}}, while the '''additional''' damage is only tagged as {{tip|spell damage}}.
** This causes it to potentially trigger {{tip|spell effects}} twice, as seen by pre-[[V26.09]] {{ri|Arcane Comet}} double cooldown reduction. [https://youtu.be/em_BMVJZQMc] {{bug|2|Started on V11.21}}|affectedEffects=Illaoi W|estimatedPatchOrigin=V11.21|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1776373785|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
** The '''additional''' damage doesn't apply {{as|{{sti|life steal}}}} but it does apply {{tip|spell vamp}} and {{tip|Omnivamp}}.
* ''Harsh Lesson'' cannot be cast while {{ai|E|Illaoi|pulling}} a {{as|Spirit|buzzword}}.
* ''Harsh Lesson'' is made of two different abilities which are decided by '''Illaoi's''' range to the target, being either {{tip|melee}} or within {{tip|dash}} range, causing interactions to act differently.
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* {{tip|Interrupt}}:
** The melee attack has an {{tip|uncancellable windup}}.
*** Starting the attack before triggering {{iis|Guardian Angel}} passive and hitting while she's in it will not cause the '''''{{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}}''''' to slam. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3pqtZtUZMqI]
** The dash attack does not have an uncancellable windup, meaning effects that can interrupt the dash will cancel the attack.
*** Unlike other empowered basic attacks, an interrupt on the dash attack will still cause the [[buff]] to be consumed and the ability to be put on cooldown. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TdO6v3SCzTw]
*** That includes self effects, such as {{si|Flash}}. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0MDFoWYI-U] {{bug|2|Added undocumented in V12.6}}
**** Based on other effects, the expectation would be to either have: ''flash'' interrupts the ''dash'' but does not negate the effect (i.e {{cai|E|Udyr}}, {{cai|E|Hecarim}}); ''flash'' is disabled (i.e {{cai|Q|Volibear}}, {{cai|Ferromancy: Mount Up|Rell}}); ''flash'' interrupts the ''dash'' and the effect, but the effect remains castable in melee range (i.e {{cai|Shield Vault 2|Pantheon|Empowered Shield Vault}}, {{cai|I|Rengar|}} {{ai|Q|Rengar}}).|affectedEffects=Illaoi W|estimatedPatchOrigin=V12.6|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1773989456|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
* {{tip|Ground}} or {{tip|root}}:
** The melee attack can be used. If '''Illaoi''' attack commands and then casts ''Harsh Lesson'' while ''rooted'', she is able to use the close range version within its dash range. {{bug|2|There have been tries to fix this bug in 9.9, 9.18 and 9.19, and yet it's still partially here.}}
** The dash ability can be cast but cannot be used while {{tip|ground|grounded}} or {{tip|root|rooted}} because '''Illaoi''' loses the {{sti|'''bonus''' attack range}}.
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* {{tip|Spell shield}}:
** The melee attack does not pop the ''spell shield''. {{bug|2|Added undocumented in V26.10}}
** The dash attack pops the ''spell shield'', preventing Tentacle commands but not preventing the '''additional''' damage. [https://youtu.be/V4GJQj9insc]|affectedEffects=Illaoi W; Spell Shield|estimatedPatchOrigin=V26.10|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1779327318|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* {{tip|Block}}, {{tip|dodge}} and {{tip|blind}}:
** '''''{{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}}''''' will slam if the melee attack is ''blocked'' [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rTgSMOuszLU], but will '''not''' if it's ''dodged'' [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r02dsIN6uBs] or if it ''misses'' [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AbeVcwWZdDs]. {{bug|2}}
*** In all cases the empowered attack '''additional''' damage is prevented. {{bug|2}}
** '''''{{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}}''''' will slam if the dash attack is ''blocked'', ''dodged'' or if it ''misses''.
*** The empowered attack '''additional''' damage is dealt when the attack is ''blocked'' or ''dodged'', but is '''not''' if it ''misses''.|affectedEffects=Illaoi W; Block; Dodge; Blind|estimatedPatchOrigin=V12.6|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1773989456|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
* The melee attack will still hit if the target becomes {{tip|untargetable}} [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cUlojKtZGF8], while the dash attack will '''not'''. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOcA7oSdlqM] {{bug|2}}
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* The melee attack will '''not''' hit if the target has {{tip|death|died}}, while the dash attack will hit. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2WgdlXm07cs]
** In a frame perfect situation, the melee attack will also hit, however it will not make the '''''{{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}}''''' slam. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMGBEXrMSio] [https://youtu.be/iMkVjZLghQg?t=10m0s] {{bug|2|1. The close version is expected to cancel if it were to hit a dead target. 2. Since patch 7.23, Tentacles are supposed to slam if the target dies during the animation.}}|affectedEffects=Illaoi W; Target Death|estimatedPatchOrigin=V7.23|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1773989456|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* The melee attack triggers '''''{{as|Tentacle|buzzword2}}''''' slams when hitting a {{tip|structure}}, while the dash attack does not. [https://youtu.be/b0Jjxxy5hxg] {{bug|2|Inconsistency appeared on V26.10}}|affectedEffects=Illaoi W|estimatedPatchOrigin=V26.10|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1779327318|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* If '''Illaoi''' has an active {{tip|spell shield}}, the melee attack will '''not''' trigger '''''{{as|Tentacle|buzzword2}}''''' slams, while the dash attack will do. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sATyJjiwt9M] {{bug|2|Inconsistency appeared on V26.10}}|affectedEffects=Illaoi W|estimatedPatchOrigin=V26.10|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1785788747|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* The melee attack triggers {{ri|Hail of Blades}}, while the dash attack does not. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NjDAm14y1HI] {{bug|2}}|affectedEffects=Illaoi W; Hail of Blades|estimatedPatchOrigin=V8.11|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1773989456|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* If the empowered attack duration ends during the melee animation, the attack won't be empowered {{bug|2}}, but if it ends during the dash - then the buff will linger until the attack has finished. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LrBXpAhSR_M]|affectedEffects=Illaoi W|estimatedPatchOrigin=V5.23|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1773989456|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* '''Illaoi''' can quickly cast other abilities after melee hitting the target, but after dash hitting there is a short delay. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P4kviRALbtk] {{bug|2}}|affectedEffects=Illaoi W|estimatedPatchOrigin=V5.23|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1773989456|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
* Abilities cannot be buffered during the melee windup but they can be buffered during the dash windup. {{bug|2}}
{{safesubst:unexpected|desc=
* Attack speed will desync the animation from the dash. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B4TNumlko-c] {{bug|2}}|affectedEffects=Illaoi W|estimatedPatchOrigin=V5.23|<!--added automatically-->wikiUploadTimestamp=1773989456|<!--added automatically-->pagename=Template:Data Illaoi/Harsh Lesson
}}
* The '''''{{as|Tentacle|buzzword2}}''''' attacking because of ''Harsh Lesson'' is considered to be of the same {{tip|cast instance}}, and thus will not grant additional stacks of {{ri|Conqueror}}, {{ri|Electrocute}} and {{nie|Tribute}}.
|tips =
* Since the mana of an ability is consumed at the end of cast time, '''Illaoi''' may still cast ''Harsh Lesson'' mid cast time of her other abilities even if her remaining mana were only enough for that other ability - potentially casting both for the price of one.
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Test of Spirit|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Illaoi
|skill        = E
|icon         = Test of Spirit.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Illaoi}} reaches with a tendril in the target direction that stops upon the first enemy hit. If the target is a {{tip|champion}}, she rips their {{as|Spirit|buzzword}} out from them to stand before her.
|blurb2       = The {{as|Spirit|buzzword}} {{tip|tether|tethers}} to the target for a duration, dealing a portion of any damage it takes. If the {{as|Spirit|buzzword}} is killed or the target leaves its range, the target will be {{tip|slow|slowed}} and marked as a {{as|Vessel|buzzword3}} for a duration or until they {{tip|takedown}} '''Illaoi''', spawning {{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}} while marked.
|blurb3       = {{as|Tentacles|buzzword2}} will autonomously attack the nearest {{as|Spirit|buzzword}} or {{as|Vessel|buzzword3}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Illaoi''' launches a tendril in the target direction that stops at the first enemy hit, pulling their {{as|Spirit|buzzword}} out in front of '''Illaoi''' over {{fd|0.75}} seconds if they are a {{tip|champion}}. The target is {{tip|tether|tethered}} to the {{as|Spirit|buzzword}} for {{tt|7 seconds|Timer starts when the target is hit}}, {{tip|true sight|revealing}} them in addition to granting {{tip|sight}} of the area around them while the tether remains.
